# Gelatinous Monster — ed (crayon warmth and a doodled grin; goofy, still dark)
# A valid Ghostty terminal theme; `# gel:` lines are the game's extensions.
# The mark override is an original doodle smiley; the typography is the
# Monaspace showcase — nav items and heading words each take a different
# face, the way the superfamily was built to mix.
